WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,390 --> 00:00:03,590
Catching knives or digging for gold and fire?

2
00:00:08,090 --> 00:00:09,090
sorry

3
00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:10,720
go all the way

4
00:00:20,490 --> 00:00:21,890
Sorry, old man

5
00:00:21,990 --> 00:00:23,290
I'll have time later

6
00:00:23,290 --> 00:00:24,690
Must come to see you

7
00:00:25,430 --> 00:00:26,430
Mo Shili

8
00:00:26,630 --> 00:00:27,730
There are actually people

9
00:00:27,730 --> 00:00:29,230
give loss gain gain

10
00:00:29,430 --> 00:00:31,530
What is your name benefactor?

11
00:00:31,730 --> 00:00:32,630
My name is Chu Yi

12
00:00:33,730 --> 00:00:34,730
It’s really Chu Yi

13
00:00:34,730 --> 00:00:39,830
The space-based mutant artist has the ability to move forward in her life, only saving people and never killing anyone, so she becomes a single person.

14
00:00:39,830 --> 00:00:41,230
More than a hundred lives were ruined

15
00:00:41,230 --> 00:00:42,430
Benefactor, what is your name?

16
00:00:42,430 --> 00:00:44,130
I will recite the Peace Sutra to you every day from now on

17
00:00:44,130 --> 00:00:45,430
May you live a long life

18
00:00:45,430 --> 00:00:46,730
To repay your life-saving grace
